  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Dr. William Sung",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 6,
   "text": "Crafting Confidence Through Dental Artistry",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. William Sung, with deep family roots in dentistry, brings his love for healthcare and advanced expertise to Katy, TX. Excelling in various dental procedures, from extractions to dental implants, he is devoted to enhancing patient confidence and comfort. Dr. Sung’s pursuit of excellence is evident in his fellowship with the Academy of General Dentistry and his commitment to continuous learning.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. William Sung, with deep family roots in dentistry, brings his love for healthcare and advanced expertise to Katy, TX. Excelling in various dental procedures, from extractions to dental implants, he is devoted to enhancing patient confidence and comfort. Dr. Sung’s pursuit of excellence is evident in his fellowship with the Academy of General Dentistry and his commitment to continuous learning.</p>",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 5,
   "text": "We are located at the corner of Mason Rd and Kingsland Blvd, behind the Ranch 99 complex",
